What's the difference between you being sick and not being sick?

1069
00:43:33,144 --> 00:43:34,943
- I couldn't finish the tteokbokki! - Gosh.

1070
00:43:34,944 --> 00:43:37,813
Around two minutes ago, she said her nose felt numb.

1071
00:43:37,814 --> 00:43:39,054
I can't taste the flavors.

1072
00:43:41,414 --> 00:43:43,853
