1078
00:43:57,634 --> 00:43:59,003
That never happens.

1079
00:43:59,004 --> 00:44:00,834
(Look at that.)

1080
00:44:02,304 --> 00:44:04,103
(Clearing her throat)

1081
00:44:04,104 --> 00:44:06,174
(Coughing)

1082
00:44:06,714 --> 00:44:08,174
It must be really painful.

1083
00:44:08,444 --> 00:44:09,984
There's a throbbing pain inside.

1084
00:44:10,284 --> 00:44:12,653
My legs went up because of the pain.

1085
00:44:12,654 --> 00:44:13,754
It's severe.

1086
00:44:14,514 --> 00:44:16,524
Gosh.

1087
00:44:18,894 --> 00:44:20,454
This is bad. My throat hurts so much.

1088
00:44:22,524 --> 00:44:26,934
(She heads to the kitchen while continuing to cough.)

1089
00:44:27,894 --> 00:44:29,004
Gosh.

1090
00:44:29,434 --> 00:44:31,364
Gosh, I got a bad cold.

1091
00:44:32,804 --> 00:44:33,833
